YANI:
Applying a cursed unicorn horn would have a chance to make you vomit, 
which would greatly increase hunger.  It would be a good idea to have a 
blessed unicorn horn on hand to undo all the other effects it has while 
you repeatedly try for the hunger increase (IIRC a blessed unihorn can 
reverse any effect of a cursed one currently, but not of course hunger, 
unless you are capable of eating it).

This YANI is good because it provides an occasionally-beneficial use for 
a formerly always-harmful object.

P.S.:
What is the effect of eating a unihorn?  IMO it should be a more 
powerful version of the (a)pply effect, as it can only be done once per 
horn.

